# firewall-extra — additional domains to allow outbound from this project's container.
# One domain per line. Blank lines and # comments OK.
# The base allowlist already covers: GitHub IPs, Anthropic, npm registry, PyPI,
# ghcr, sentry, statsig, VS Code marketplace. Only add things beyond that.
# This project's patched init-firewall.sh also accepts raw IPv4/CIDR lines.

